  "metadata": {
    "name": "StepSequencer",
    "description": "One lane of a step sequencer: sixteen values walked by a clock. A second lane on the same clock locks any knob per step. Try: Two lanes, one clock. The first walks the pitch through the quantizer; the second locks the filter per step — steps 3, 6 and 8 snap it open. Turn any step knob on either lane and only that step changes. That is a parameter lock. Generated by tools/node-demos.mjs. Do not edit by hand.",
